+Background jobs, such as order confirmation emails, are rows in the `Job` table, run by `npm run worker` (`src/lib/jobs.ts`). Several workers can run at once; each job runs once. A failed job is retried after `JOB_RETRY_DELAY_MS`, three attempts in all, and then kept with its last error.
